//Simple help file autoloaded when just running ./app without params
PRINT "CFAB-computer/V2 Interpreter\n"
PRINT "Intended to run fabricated instruction files, created using fabricator.py.\n"
PRINT "Command arguments;\n"
PRINT " - [file/f]    Loads a bytes-data file from data dir beside interpreter.\n"
PRINT " - [verbose/v] Outputs every instruction processed (Operands, name, etc.)\n"
PRINT " - [test/t]    Runs built-in unit testing.\n"
PRINT " - [rate/r]    Gives total number of instructions executed, time taken and frequency.\n"
PRINT " - [peek/p]    Peek memory after execution. (e.g. [r 0] or [ram 24])\n"
PRINT " - [debug/d]   Runs hardcoded debug function [DEV]\n"
PRINT " - [colour/c]  Sets the RAM-Graphics mode. Can be text, 256-colour or RGB. [NONE/TEXT/256/RGB]\n"